Package: anaume
Title: Adverse Event Analysis for PMDA Queries in Oncology
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Shunsuke", "Goto", , "first.last@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides utilities for summarizing adverse events for analysis
    required by the Pharmaceuticals and Medical Devices Agency (PMDA) in the
    oncology therapeutic area. Creates analysis-ready data (ARD) for adverse
    event queries.
